","programmingLanguage":"JavaScript"}{ $group : { _id : "$<field>" } }For more information on behavior for retrieving distinct values, see the distinct command behavior.To see whether your operation results in a DISTINCT_SCAN, check your operation's explain results.Group by RatingThe following aggregation operation groups documents by the rated field, calculating the total runtime per rating and returning only the ratings with a total runtime greater than or equal to 100000:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","codeSampleType":"code snippet","text":"db.movies.aggregate(
   [
      // First Stage
      {
         $group: {
            _id: "$rated",
            totalRuntime: { $sum: "$runtime" }
         }
      },
      // Second Stage
      {
         $match: { "totalRuntime": { $gte: 100000 } }
      }
   ]
)

","programmingLanguage":"JavaScript"}db.movies.aggregate(   [      // First Stage      {         $group: {            _id: "$rated",            totalRuntime: { $sum: "$runtime" }         }      },      // Second Stage      {         $match: { "totalRuntime": { $gte: 100000 } }      }   ])HIDE OUTPUT{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","codeSampleType":"code snippet","text":"[
