Pivot DataGroup Titles by YearThe following aggregation operation pivots the data in the movies collection to group titles by year:{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","codeSampleType":"code snippet","text":"db.movies.aggregate([
   { $match: { year: { $lt: 1910 } } },
   { $group: { _id: "$year", titles: { $push: "$title" } } },
   { $sort: { _id: 1 } }
])

","programmingLanguage":"JavaScript"}db.movies.aggregate([   { $match: { year: { $lt: 1910 } } },   { $group: { _id: "$year", titles: { $push: "$title" } } },   { $sort: { _id: 1 } }])HIDE OUTPUT{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"SoftwareSourceCode","codeSampleType":"code snippet","text":"[
